  "title": "Apple Butter Bread",
  "description": "This apple butter bread recipe makes an easy-to-prepare, very moist, spiced bread with the taste of raisins, walnuts, and apple butter in every bite.",
  "authors": [
    "Bruce Stone"
  ],
